{"id":"25483faf64333446","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-cut-elimination-property.md","title":"演算的切消性质","display":"df-cut-elimination-property — 演算的切消性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-cut-elimination-property","aliases":["18-df-cut-elimination-property","18-df-037"],"display":"df-cut-elimination-property — 演算的切消性质","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]","[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-cut-elimination-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-cut-elimination-property</span><span>18-df-037</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cut-elimination-property — 演算的切消性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a> 的规则实例集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutFree}\">\\(\\mathrm{CutFree}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"570d01ae273edcd2\" href=\"?note=570d01ae273edcd2\" title=\"18-df-proof-cut-rank\">18-df-proof-cut-rank</a> 的定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为上游谓词；本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T\\,\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal T&#39;\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T&#39;}(r_{\\mathcal T&#39;})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T\\,\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal T&#39;\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T&#39;)\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T&#39;}(r_{\\mathcal T&#39;})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地定义某演算“具有切消性质”的谓词，不是任意演算都具有该性质的定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集；$\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 取 [[18-df-proof-cut-rank]] 的定义。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-cut-rank","status":"resolved","id":"570d01ae273edcd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ 为 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的规则实例集；$\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 取 [[18-df-proof-cut-rank]] 的定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutFree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CutElimination}(\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal T\\,\\bigl(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal T'\\,(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T')\\land\\mathrm{CutFree}(\\mathcal T')\n\\land\\ell_{\\mathcal T'}(r_{\\mathcal T'})=\\ell_{\\mathcal T}(r_{\\mathcal T}))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1125,"backlinks":[{"id":"c78f3207eb79266e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[18-df-proof-tree]] 的双边规则集 $\\mathcal P$；空相继式是 $e=\\langle\\varnothing,\\varnothing\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{CutElimination}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CutFree}$ 见 [[18-df-cut-elimination-property]]、[[18-df-proof-cut-rank]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-elimination-property|18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-cut-elimination-property|18-df-cut-elimination-property]]"}],"outgoing":["68c5bcff4a164cd8","570d01ae273edcd2"]}